ou, or Nanjing."],["Mr Harry Authentic British Restaurant","restaurant",31.2329,121.4605,"5th floor, 819 West Nanjing Road","10:00-22:00","","","","r","If you have been in China a while and want to enjoy a break with an English breakfast or fish and chips for lunch, then Mr Harry's is possibly the place for you. English pub style decorations and English beer available."]]}